@startuml
title Proposed deterministic delivery state
[*] --> PLANNED
PLANNED --> AWAITING_APPROVAL
AWAITING_APPROVAL --> AUTHORIZED : exact human grant and quality
AUTHORIZED --> BRANCH_PREPARED : isolated verified branch
BRANCH_PREPARED --> AWAITING_PUBLICATION
AWAITING_PUBLICATION --> PR_PUBLISHED : authorized push and reconciled PR
PR_PUBLISHED --> CHECKS_PENDING
CHECKS_PENDING --> REVIEW_PENDING : required exact-head checks pass
REVIEW_PENDING --> READY_FOR_AUTHORIZED_MERGE : human requirements and dependencies met
PR_PUBLISHED --> BLOCKED : unmet policy
CHECKS_PENDING --> BLOCKED : failure or stale evidence
REVIEW_PENDING --> BLOCKED : missing or dismissed review
READY_FOR_AUTHORIZED_MERGE --> BLOCKED : head, base or policy changed
AUTHORIZED --> RECOVERY_REQUIRED : ambiguous local operation
AWAITING_PUBLICATION --> RECOVERY_REQUIRED : ambiguous push or create
RECOVERY_REQUIRED --> PR_PUBLISHED : observed exact remote identity
RECOVERY_REQUIRED --> BLOCKED : discrepancy or missing authorization
BLOCKED --> AWAITING_APPROVAL : reviewed revised scope
AUTHORIZED --> FAILED : known nonrecoverable failure
note right of READY_FOR_AUTHORIZED_MERGE
Readiness is recomputed.
No merge is performed.
end note
@enduml
